{"metadata": {"version": "0.3.3", "copyright": "Copyright (c) 2026 graineo project; format and method by Andrea Volpato (spektrafilm). Licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.", "created": "2026-10-28", "license": "spektrafilm profile by Andrea Volpato, licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0. Redistribution and derivatives must credit the author, link the project (https://github.com/andreavolpato/spektrafilm),preserve this license, and remain CC BY-SA 4.0.Modifications must be noted. Full text of the license and attribution requirements: https://github.com/andreavolpato/spektrafilm/blob/main/SPEKTRAFILM_LICENSE.txt.", "citation": "If you use this profile in your work, please cite the spektrafilm project: https://github.com/andreavolpato/spektrafilm, see CITATION.cff for details.", "datasource": "Characteristic curves (ILFORD ID-11 stock, 8 min = mean gradient 0.62 and 10 min = 0.70, 20 C, intermittent agitation, 'Pictorial Contrast') and spectral sensitivity digitised from the Ilford data sheet (ORTHO PLUS technical information, October 2019, pages 1 and 3). Original data are property of Harman technology Limited (Ilford). The data sheet gives relative log exposure only: the exposure axis was anchored so that the speed point (density = fog + 0.1) lies at log10(0.8/ISO 80) lux-s (daylight speed), and shifted by log10(14.5/ISO) = -0.74 log lux-s so that 0 is the mid-grey exposure at box speed. Sensitivity offset chosen so that mid-grey renders at the reference level; the sheet gives one relative spectral sensitivity curve without stating light source or energy/quantum basis, used as given (blue to about 565 nm, steep drop beyond; no red sensitivity). Tail above the sheet range extrapolated with decaying slope. Wavelengths outside the range of the sheet curve (above about 566 nm) carry a floor of log10 sensitivity = -6, i.e. about five decades below the plateau: practically blind, as the sheet shows no red sensitivity.", "modifications": "New profile created from manufacturer data by the graineo project; only the profile format and wavelength grid taken from spektrafilm."}, "info": {"grain_size_classes": {"classes": 4, "area_spread": 5.0, "speed_exponent": 1.0}, "stock": "ilford_ortho_plus", "name": "Ilford ORTHO Plus Black and White Orthochromatic Film, ID-11", "type": "negative", "support": "film", "stage": "filming", "use": "still", "antihalation": "strong", "target_print": null, "channel_model": "bw", "densitometer": "diffuse_visual", "log_sensitivity_density_over_min": 1.0, "reference_illuminant": "D55", "viewing_illuminant": "D50", "default_look": {"paper": "ilford_multigrade_iv_rc", "paper_grade": 3.0, "film_dev": 8.0, "print_ev": -0.4}, "card": {"maker": "Ilford", "iso": 80, "type": "Schwarzwei\u00dfnegativfilm (orthochromatisch)", "rms": null, "additional": "Datenblatt (ohne Zahlenwerte), hochaufl\u00f6sender Reproduktionsfilm", "text": "Sieht Blau und Gr\u00fcn, aber kein Rot: Rot und Orange werden sehr dunkel, Lippen und Haut wirken dunkler und kr\u00e4ftiger gezeichnet, Himmel und Bl\u00e4tter hell. Urspr\u00fcnglich ein hochaufl\u00f6sender Reproduktionsfilm, im Portr\u00e4t ein eigener, unverwechselbarer Look. Mit Rotfilter oder bei r\u00f6tlichem Licht entsprechend dunkler.", "spectrum": "orthochromatisch: Empfindlichkeit von UV bis etwa 565 nm, danach steiler Abfall (kein Rot)", "source": "Ilford ORTHO Plus", "process": "Schwarzwei\u00df-Negativentwicklung", "suitable": ["Portr\u00e4t mit kr\u00e4ftig gezeichneter Haut", "Landschaft mit hellem Laub und Himmel", "Reproduktion und Kopieren"], "less_suitable": ["rote Motive (werden schwarz)", "Kunstlicht (Rotanteil fehlt)"], "tips": ["Der Look \u201eAbgestimmt\u201c arbeitet ohne Aufnahmefilter, weil der Film Rot ohnehin nicht sieht; Rot- und Orangefilter lassen kaum noch Licht durch, das er verwerten kann.", "Der Filmlook \u201eOrtho \u00b7 hart\u201c (Entwicklung 10 Minuten, Papiergrad 4) zeigt den harten Look des Films."], "facts": [{"text": "Das Datenblatt nennt Ortho Plus urspr\u00fcnglich einen hochaufl\u00f6senden Kopierfilm. Wegen der fehlenden Rotempfindlichkeit erscheinen rote und orange Farben deutlich dunkler; das gilt als gew\u00fcnschter Effekt.", "source": "Ilford Ortho Plus, Technical Information"}, {"text": "Der Film l\u00e4sst sich unter tiefrotem Dunkelkammerlicht handhaben und sogar nach Sicht entwickeln; Kleinbild-Patronen sind auf ISO 80 (Tageslicht) codiert, bei Kunstlicht r\u00e4t Ilford zu ISO 40.", "source": "Ilford Ortho Plus, Technical Information"}]}}, "data": {"wavelengths": [380.0, 385.0, 390.0, 395.0, 400.0, 405.0, 410.0, 415.0, 420.0, 425.0, 430.0, 435.0, 440.0, 445.0, 450.0, 455.0, 460.0, 465.0, 470.0, 475.0, 480.0, 485.0, 490.0, 495.0, 500.0, 505.0, 510.0, 515.0, 520.0, 525.0, 530.0, 535.0, 540.0, 545.0, 550.0, 555.0, 560.0, 565.0, 570.0, 575.0, 580.0, 585.0, 590.0, 595.0, 600.0, 605.0, 610.0, 615.0, 620.0, 625.0, 630.0, 635.0, 640.0, 645.0, 650.0, 655.0, 660.0, 665.0, 670.0, 675.0, 680.0, 685.0, 690.0, 695.0, 700.0, 705.0, 710.0, 715.0, 720.0, 725.0, 730.0, 735.0, 740.0, 745.0, 750.0, 755.0, 760.0, 765.0, 770.0, 775.0, 780.0], "log_sensitivity": [[-0.9252177832602406], [-0.8725518312701871], [-0.834558517196203], [-0.8078704817283456], [-0.7866006948464143], [-0.772127067175338], [-0.7613900594847596], [-0.7555012305216566], [-0.7523447691033927], [-0.7511364251192065], [-0.7511364251192065], [-0.7525864915144393], [-0.753451693749375], [-0.7540414157626137], [-0.7540414157626137], [-0.7540414157626137], [-0.7555012305216566], [-0.758435663860706], [-0.7613900594847596], [-0.7653961100568892], [-0.7725790055365812], [-0.780416865379762], [-0.7915649757170551], [-0.805910009741432], [-0.8213120220155453], [-0.8320166736963065], [-0.8355607265792032], [-0.8285839583578308], [-0.8155972039272348], [-0.7946211673216212], [-0.7749393397918314], [-0.7589792820196316], [-0.7515156950865398], [-0.750912497480545], [-0.7642227215858656], [-0.7972774302038813], [-0.879304653024422], [-1.4302808924439843], [-6.0], [-6.0], [-6